Subject: Information for adoption of E.Africa EMU Credit

TO : WOG, WSG, DME
FM : CTY-EQ / OW CHOI

Thank you very much for your cooperation
We are deeply thinking about Request of E-Africa EMU Credit Concern.
At this juncture, We have decided EMU Credit for E.Africa as below

-      As below

1.    Adoption Cost
We have referenced MEO Report for KEMBA/TZDAR Cost ,
For about Credit + Dest supply cost about USD $50-$100

w  KEMBA : D2 USD $153, D4 USD $251

w  TZDAR : D2 USD $  99, D4 USD $171
[cid:image001.jpg@01CEE7A6.2D0F06F0]
2. Type/Size of Adoption (It is only adopted for about existing of MB Perfo=
rmance Type/Size)

w  KEMBA - D2/D4/D5/O2/O4/R5

w  TZDAR - D2/D4/D5/F4/O2
=3D>  Adopted of Total Credit ratio 100%
3. Territory of Adoption Credit

w  Far-East & S.W.Asia Demand Areas (Same as ex-Europe/US/AUS/M.E cargo)
4. It will adopt EMU Cost for Inbound Cargo (Take MB Imbalance into conside=
ration)

Thank you
b.rgds / ow choi

